WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Gcina imibhede emine isendaweni yayo. Hambisa umndeni ngamunye njalo ngonyaka.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Ngonyaka wokuqala, iklabishi likhula embhedeni wokuqala.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Ngonyaka wesibili, hambisa iklabishi. Izaqathe zithatha indawo yalo.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Ngonyaka wesithathu, ubhontshisi usembhedeni wokuqala.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Ngonyaka wesine, u-anyanisi uthatha umbhede wokuqala.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Umbhede wokuqala ube nemindeni emine ehlukene eminyakeni emine. Umjikelezo usungaqala futhi.
